ference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":89185,\"title\":\"Radio Rebel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wycDdx2BrdNKlyTZoZT8uLeu6dq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuhKYERTbwHmQPoqhl2AuzP2XPM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"High school senior Tara is so painfully shy that she dreads speaking to anyone in the hallways or getting called on in class. But in the privacy of her bedroom with her iPod in hand, she rocks out -- doing mock broadcasts for Miami's hottest FM radio station, which happens to be owned by her stepfather. When a slot opens up at The SLAM, Tara surprises herself by blossoming behind the mike into confident, \\\"Radio Rebel\\\" -- and to everyone's shock, she's a hit!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":32293,\"title\":\"The Cheetah Girls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7XOJqR8WErIm1ZqytABCEuUke1C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJVUx5xUes9cTDpMiNWx4Fab2ac.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A four-member teen girl group named the Cheetah Girls go to a Manhattan High School for the Performing Arts and try to become the first freshmen to win the talent show in the school's history. During the talent show auditions, they meet a big-time producer named Jackal Johnson, who tries to make the group into superstars, but the girls run into many problems.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":409447,\"title\":\"Hairspray Live!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3T1u2DzwfDUd5iMNw4gqFWQx3P2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lqaouqbfPzFLRpuqaZkbtbT6hP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenage girl living in Baltimore in the early 1960s dreams of appearing on a popular TV dance show.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":110490,\"title\":\"Rags\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5CfrXWMeGcMlisL1YRCgpFMWiER.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rTHODCYE1nth5sUXwdbZtFhny4M.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rags follows the story of Charlie Prince, an orphan living with his acerbic and unloving stepfather and spoiled, simple-minded stepbrothers. Charlie's dream is to be a singer, and while he is vocally talented and can write music, he can't seem to catch a break. Kadee Worth, on the other hand, is the daughter of music mogul Reginald Worth and is an international pop phenomenon. While the world knows her as a glamorous superstar, she is secretly frustrated with singing other people's songs and wearing clothes other people choose for her. Kadee wants the world to hear and see her true talent. Despite every obstacle that gets thrown in their way, once Charlie and Kadee find one another, they each finally get what they have been looking for – a voice, a stage, an audience and each other.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":330544,\"title\":\"Bessie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kanAZsL3kZwFWRuR6tqLvNrEFco.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pPoIJJ7ylLULMbpHNWdg8Ab7CF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of legendary blues performer, Bessie Smith, who rose to fame during the 1920s and '30s.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":173153,\"title\":\"Phil Spector\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vGLqUtMmZPEes7q59GoNusNNtjY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t6d3Zw4hTkaPoQ75dRvnxCrN8Ms.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A drama centered on the relationship between Phil Spector and defen